BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 590.00 Tm (The trap that sinks new operators first is the gap between delivering and getting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 574.77 Tm (paid. Giganomic Era warns that direct clients pay by invoice, sometimes weeks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 559.55 Tm (after the work is done, so a fuel cushion has to exist before the first route starts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 544.32 Tm ([7Mz5ctFZBX0 @ 00:02:11]. Medical Courier Connection puts harder numbers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 529.10 Tm (on it: purchasing departments stack approval layers, and a contract nobody read) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 513.87 Tm (closely can mean 90 days before the first check lands, with routed work billed at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 498.65 Tm (the start of the month and paid in 20-30 days [o1VRiVMJTpY @ 00:04:38]. Ken) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 483.42 Tm (and Linda also lived the credit-card version of this squeeze, funding the business) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 468.20 Tm (on plastic and watching 'the best like 900 credit rating' fall to a 400 credit rating) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 452.97 Tm (in a single year [o1VRiVMJTpY @ 00:50:26]. Davis's level-one numbers show) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 437.75 Tm (the same leak on the app side: a 0.9-mile Roadie delivery paid $8, about $1 a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 422.52 Tm (mile typical, and unpaid deadhead 'killed it' [9oGonGv8OLc @ 00:09:52]. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 407.30 Tm (economics check is blunt. Hold three months of operating expenses, push every) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 392.07 Tm (client for ACH, and stack routes so the vehicle earns on every leg, because) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 376.85 Tm (revenue sitting on an unpaid invoice does nothing for a tank that needs filling on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 361.62 Tm (Monday morning.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 346.40 Tm (The second cluster of losses comes from paper signed without leverage.) Tj ET
